1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,795
Part 3 of local Oracle APEX for AI agents.

2
00:00:04,055 --> 00:00:08,072
The agent edits the app, and the open page follows by itself.

3
00:00:09,222 --> 00:00:12,213
Without that, an agent works blind between steps.

4
00:00:12,473 --> 00:00:15,649
Edit, reload, find the page again, take a screenshot.

5
00:00:15,909 --> 00:00:17,858
Every check is another round trip.

6
00:00:19,008 --> 00:00:23,183
Now every preview page keeps a WebSocket open to the local server.

7
00:00:23,443 --> 00:00:28,346
The server pushes three things: source edits, data changes, and who is watching.

8
00:00:29,496 --> 00:00:32,762
The agent renames the page in its APEXlang file.

9
00:00:33,022 --> 00:00:36,921
A quarter of a second later, the open page has reloaded itself.

10
00:00:38,071 --> 00:00:41,422
Next, it adds a chart region with its own SQL.

11
00:00:41,682 --> 00:00:44,635
Saved, reloaded, and already drawn from the data.

12
00:00:45,785 --> 00:00:48,736
A typo usually means a blank page and a guess.

13
00:00:48,996 --> 00:00:53,093
Here the parse error, with file and line, appears on the open page.

14
00:00:53,353 --> 00:00:56,867
The agent fixes it and turns the gauge into a bar chart.

15
00:00:58,017 --> 00:01:02,023
The agent can also work in its own session, signed in as AGENT.

16
00:01:02,283 --> 00:01:04,591
The toolbar shows two viewers on this page.

17
00:01:05,741 --> 00:01:09,303
Now the agent saves stock changes in an interactive grid.

18
00:01:09,563 --> 00:01:13,597
On your dashboard, every region that reads that table redraws.

19
00:01:13,857 --> 00:01:17,125
Ten regions, in under a tenth of a second, without a reload.

20
00:01:18,275 --> 00:01:21,588
Each region is mapped to the tables its SQL reads.

21
00:01:21,848 --> 00:01:25,913
Views resolve to their base tables, and static text is ignored.

22
00:01:27,063 --> 00:01:30,627
For the agent, one open tab becomes a live monitor.

23
00:01:30,887 --> 00:01:36,426
It sees the effect of every edit and every save, across pages, without navigating.

24
00:01:36,686 --> 00:01:38,605
And you watch its work as it happens.

25
00:01:39,755 --> 00:01:44,488
Unsaved grid edits are never overwritten; the page shows a notice instead.

26
00:01:44,748 --> 00:01:49,941
Forms are not refreshed, refresh loops are blocked, and it all stays on localhost.

27
00:01:51,091 --> 00:01:53,328
The agent edits. The page follows.

28
00:01:53,588 --> 00:01:56,935
A design aid on your laptop, not Oracle evidence.

